{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1792571940, "covers_from": "2026-10-21T08:39:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-21T08:40:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1792572000, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-21T08:39:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 8, "queue_number": 68571, "sprite_key": "penguin_oldtown", "district": "zhongzheng", "topic": "教育", "content": "取消國英數學力檢測\n避免考試導向教學\n回歸正常教學", "display_name": "中正代表 lephing (Leeping)丁麗萍", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": false}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-21T08:39:08+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 63447, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_suburb", "district": "beitou", "topic": "環境", "content": "孩子需要戶外運動，夏天公園蚊蟲小黑蚊多；冬天雨水多，公園缺少雨遮，台北的冬天放電空間不夠孩子使用", "display_name": "北投代表 No.63,447", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-21T08:39:23+00:00", "duration_seconds": 8, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 24839, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "環境", "content": "我好怕台北市的樹再這樣砍下去，我熟悉的台北市不在了", "display_name": "大安代表 Janet Lai", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-21T08:39:31+00:00", "duration_seconds": 11, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 38730, "sprite_key": "beaver_culture", "district": "zhongshan", "topic": "公共安全", "content": "中山站無差別事件後不敢帶孩子走誠品那一帶。怕人多遇到事情跑不掉", "display_name": "中山代表 No.38,730", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-21T08:39:42+00:00", "duration_seconds": 18, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 1118, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "交通", "content": "很多公車都沒等乘客站穩或坐好，就開動，連我這種年輕人都有時來不及站穩；何況是老人或小孩，因而跌倒常有", "display_name": "大安代表 No.1,118", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 63447, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_suburb", "display_name": "北投代表 No.63,447", "district": "beitou", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 24839, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "display_name": "大安代表 Janet Lai", "district": "daan", "is_re